      "content": "Programmatically manage Google Cloud projects, folders, and organizations. The Cloud Resource Manager API enables you to create, read, update, and delete projects, folders, and organizations in the Google Cloud resource hierarchy. It provides the foundation for organizing and governing Google Cloud resources through a hierarchical structure of organizations, folders, and projects.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Google Cloud Platform",
